   "page": 26,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If ECG unavailable: refer same day to nearest facility where available.",
   "bbox": [
    189.8,
    442.5,
    437.9,
    452.7
   ],
   "key": "p26-1840727f"
  },
  {
   "id": "p26-out-e12",
   "page": 26,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Identify triggers. If palpitations are linked to smoking, excessive alcohol binges, caffeine, stimulants (diet pills or cocaine/ amphetamines), advise to cut down or avoid these. • Palpitations may be related to anxiety: decide this only once all other causes are excluded. Assess for stress and anxiety 98.",
